<h1>@ViewBag.Title</h1>
<p>Number of products: @ViewBag.ProductCounttt</p>
<p>Loop through products:</p>
<ul>
    @foreach (var item in (ViewBag.Items as IEnumerable<ProductViewModel>) ?? [])
    {
        <li>@item.Name - &pound;@item.Price.ToString()</li>
    }
</ul>
<p>ViewBag internally inserts data into ViewData dictionary. As such the key of ViewData and property of ViewBag must    NOT match.</p>